      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "## Topology Observability Overview\nThis dashboard summarizes the current live topology slice exposed by the platform. It focuses on bounded, real evidence: topology node and link counts, state distributions, inference quality, and the backend/collector metrics that support the topology product page.\n\nCurrent limits:\n- The topology model is live and useful, but intentionally partial.\n- Links are inferred from interface naming and operational state rather than LLDP, IGP, or ODL enrichment.\n- Partial knowledge remains explicit through degraded and single-sided link signals.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "title": "Dashboard Scope",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 2,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Topology Health Signals",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0,
                  "text": "Down"
                },
                "1": {
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1,
                  "text": "Up"
                }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
